OL,3,ALife after Eurovision for Look Mum No
OL,4,AComputer
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepresenting the UK at the Eurovision
OL,7,FSong Contest brought Sam Battle one
OL,8,Fpoint, but the musician has said the
OL,9,Fresult is a "badge of honour".
OL,11,FBattle, better known by his stage name
OL,12,FLook Mum No Computer, represented the
OL,13,FUK at this year's Eurovision Song
OL,14,FContest with the electronic pop song
OL,15,FEins, Zwei, Drei.
OL,17,FLooking back on the competition, he
OL,18,Fsaid the experience passed in a blur.
OL,19,F"It just happened so quick," he said.
OL,20,F"I didn't even realise. I was just
OL,21,Flike, 'oh, I'm jumping on tables, don't
OL,22,Ffall off the table, Sam, sing'."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
